native-dawn builds Google's Dawn WebGPU implementation and its Node-API
bindings. Dawn source: https://dawn.googlesource.com/dawn
The exact revision is recorded in upstream.json. Binary archives include the
Dawn license and the licenses of its bundled dependencies under
share/native-dawn/licenses.

The handling of @kmamal/sdl window handles follows Konstantin M's
@kmamal/gpu (MIT): https://github.com/kmamal/gpu, at the revision recorded
in upstream.json.
